# Raw secret value, one line, no KEY= prefix — this is the password for
# the dedicated uid=jellyfin,ou=people,... LLDAP bind account
# (modules/media-stack.nix), read by the jellyfin-ldap-plugin-setup
# systemd oneshot at first boot to write the LDAP-Auth plugin's own
# config file. Generate a real one with: openssl rand -hex 16
REPLACE-ME-WITH-A-REAL-SECRET-AT-LEAST-8-CHARS
